\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Hierarchical architecture of the multi-scale biomolecular dynamics framework. The engine couples coarse-grained $C_\alpha $ ENM elasticity (for large-amplitude domain modes), an all-atom heavy-atom force field with Hawkins--Cramer--Truhlar Generalized Born and LCPO surface area continuum solvation, well-tempered funnel metadynamics along the radial distance $r$, and a 4-state Markovian Chemical Master Equation analyzed via Transition Path Theory.}}{5}{figure.caption.1}\protected@file@percent }
