\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces (a) Pearson correlation between simulated $C_\alpha $ root-mean-square fluctuations (converted to $B_{\rm  sim}$) and experimental crystallographic $B$-factors ($R = 0.84$) for T4 Lysozyme L99A. (b) Performance scaling benchmark: execution and rendering throughput (Frames Per Second, FPS) across total atom counts $N \in [164, 7500]$, comparing WebGPU compute pipelines, 4-thread Web Worker pools, and single-threaded JavaScript execution. The dashed horizontal line indicates the 30 FPS interactive threshold.}}{23}{figure.caption.9}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:perf}{{4}{23}{(a) Pearson correlation between simulated $C_\alpha $ root-mean-square fluctuations (converted to $B_{\rm sim}$) and experimental crystallographic $B$-factors ($R = 0.84$) for T4 Lysozyme L99A. (b) Performance scaling benchmark: execution and rendering throughput (Frames Per Second, FPS) across total atom counts $N \in [164, 7500]$, comparing WebGPU compute pipelines, 4-thread Web Worker pools, and single-threaded JavaScript execution. The dashed horizontal line indicates the 30 FPS interactive threshold}{figure.caption.9}{}}
